# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Jadefire Glen
  tip The Jadefire satyrs hold the glen west of the road, with Xavathras at its back.
  tip Careful: Jadefire Shadowstalkers (level 51-52) use Sneak and Slowing Poison and are stealthed, so they often join fights uninvited.
  tip Cursed Oozes slide about the glen's streams: kill them and use Laris's Empty Ooze Jar on their remains.
  kill 7109 quest 4421.1              -- Jadefire Felsworn
  collect 11947 quest 4512.1          -- Filled Cursed Ooze Jar
  level 52.74 grind 7109               -- grind on Jadefire Felsworn

