step Felpaw Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolgs of Felpaw Village fill the hills west of the cave. Keep killing them until one drops a Deadwood Ritual Totem, about one kill in thirty, then right-click it: Kernda in Timbermaw Hold takes it once the Timbermaw are Neutral to you, now if they already are, or when the last guide passes the cave again at 58.
  tip Careful: Den Watchers are level 53-54; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%.
  kill 7156 quest 8461.1              -- Deadwood Den Watcher
  kill 7157 quest 8461.2              -- Deadwood Avenger
  kill 7158 quest 8461.3              -- Deadwood Shaman
  collect 20741                       -- Deadwood Ritual Totem
